# Rotate a service token

1. Create a new service token.
2. Update the service to use the new token.
3. Validate that the service works, then revoke the old token.

::: warning
Keep the old token until you have validated the new one.
:::

The tokens can overlap for 24 hours.[^overlap]

[^overlap]: The 24-hour overlap gives you time to update the service and confirm that the new token works before revoking the old one.